{
  "uid": "wow-honeypot-attacks",
  "title": "WOWHoneypot - Attack Dashboard",
  "tags": [
    "honeypot",
    "security",
    "wow"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 4,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 101,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 📊 サマリー — 攻撃全体統計\nVPSのWOWHoneypotに届いた累積リクエストの概要。**Total HTTP Requests**: 全リクエスト総数 / **Unique Source IPs**: ユニーク送信元IP数 / **Matched Attack Requests**: 攻撃ルールにマッチした累積数 / **Last Log Sync**: 最終ログ同期日時"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Total Requests (累積)",
      "description": "エクスポーター起動以来の累積リクエスト数（HTTP + HTTPS 合計）。時系列グラフが0でもこの値は高い — 時系列は「現在の処理レート」、この値は「これまでの合計」を示す。",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(wowhoneypot_http_requests_total)",
          "legendFormat": "Total"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Unique Source IPs",
